    "description": "HG-1 (FGC-9 MKI): Laffs Dynamics\n\nFirst Laffs Dynamics design handguard design for the FGC-9 weapon platform. \n\nSpecifically for the MKI, simplistic in design; has five full M-Lok slots, and five 1/2 sized M-Lok slots. \n\nHas side section reinforcements, and ten dedicated top sectional heat vents. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 38%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 20% \n\nPrint the handguard on it front face. \n\n\n\nNotes:\n\n1) This data pack is just for printing the handguard. To get the base firearm data pack, use the following link: \n(https://odysee.com/@TheGatalog-HybridDesigns:0/FGC-9:e)",
